# 1. sets up paths,
# 2. builds a big list of QTLtools commands to run (18,000 of them),
# 3. splits that list into bite-size files,
# 4. submits many small batch jobs that each run a mini-scheduler called selfsched (via MPI) to execute those commands in parallel,
# 5. checks that things finished,
# 6. concatenates chunk outputs into per-parameter files,
# 7. cleans up.

